#
#   input_colors - Painting::InputColors: the shades form controls are painted with
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/InputColors.h (lines 1-57). The color names reflect
#       what the colors would be for a light theme, not necessarily the actual colors.
